rtdNG", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nekogyo122/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a3bd36e/uploads/origins/19604182-73b2-4a35-b1ce-9e6c82e7ee88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d8ec6dd8041e601c834f82e6ced16fd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a3bd36e/uploads/origins/19604182-73b2-4a35-b1ce-9e6c82e7ee88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d8ec6dd8041e601c834f82e6ced16fd, https://si.imgix.net/9a3bd36e/uploads/origins/19604182-73b2-4a35-b1ce-9e6c82e7ee88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d188403249ef69d731e63e79df585f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a3bd36e/uploads/origins/19604182-73b2-4a35-b1ce-9e6c82e7ee88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f55471c956709675f30d9e6726fb99cd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！ねこぎょーざさんの作品が大好きです！\nこの子のイラストをお願いします。\nキャラクター：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yOh-CzqZePuu4m4qHRuYAmrp5vMgFqfA\n\nいつものキャラクター設定風のように：\nhttps://twitter.com/nekogyo122/status/1752647914935984192\nhttps://twitter.com/nekogyo122/status/1680895120512782337\n\nポーズと背景と表情とはお任せ、ご自由に描いてください。\nありがとうございます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nekogyo122/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e12943ee/uploads/origins/b15a3276-21cf-43cc-9490-0d116067c1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0ee7a657b3e20c149c2a9cb624081c9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e12943ee/uploads/origins/b15a3276-21cf-43cc-9490-0d116067c1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c0ee7a657b3e20c149c2a9cb624081c9, https://si.imgix.net/e12943ee/uploads/origins/b15a3276-21cf-43cc-9490-0d116067c1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67c01dafefd77a58244464507380b37c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e12943ee/uploads/origins/b15a3276-21c